## Design patterns

none — no force in the spec, no symptom on disk

One row per pattern this layer adopts, decided through
`@.claude/skills/gof-design-patterns/SKILL.md` § Design-time use:
`| Force or symptom | Pattern | Classes and interfaces it creates | "When not" checked |`.
The force is a spec line or a `file:line`, never "might grow". Every class a row creates is
also listed where this partial lists what the executor writes; reshaping code an approved
case produced is a row in the section below. Consolidation collects this section into
`UC-NNN-spec.md`.

